# Aamon, Duke of Shards

> Aamon is a magic assassin whose real job starts after somebody else has damaged the target. His camouflage lets him choose the second entry, his shards punish runners, and his ultimate converts low health into a kill. Pick him when your team can start fights without him; lose with him when you ask him to start them.

